{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國天后珍妮花露柏絲（Jennifer Lopez）前晚於美國紐約「大都會藝術服裝學院」一慈善晚宴上演出，事後她於社交網分享當晚演出時的照片。</p><p>她於當晚的演出為樂迷帶來驚喜，首度獻唱新歌《Proof of Love》。她以一身性感魚網衫出場並大晒其招牌巨躉。而她亦於社交網宣布將去年於拉斯維加斯舉行的駐場騷輯錄成演唱會電影《The JLo Show》，並於本月底感恩節當日在影視串流平台與電視台放映。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:47:18.658435+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:08:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:13.835180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:40:41.985320+00:00","content_hash":"10dd760eb39f34d98d558af924b288d79312d2a0fdc60feaf9fe864e22e8406f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:47:18.658435+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}